# Golden test artifacts are byte-compared against `serde_json::to_string_pretty`
# output by the Rust golden tests (e.g. crates/ncu/veloq-ncu/tests/verb_goldens.rs,
# via UPDATE_GOLDENS=1). prettier's JSON layout (compact short arrays) differs from
# serde's, so reformatting these here silently breaks the byte-exact comparison and
# turns the test:unit CI job red. Leave generated goldens untouched.
**/tests/goldens/

# CHANGELOG.md contains literal `*` in its prose (e.g. `cmdlists*`,
# `**/tests/goldens/`) that prettier escapes to `\*`, mangling the text.
# Leave this file's format untouched.
/CHANGELOG.md
